      <activity id="c905f5f2-19a1-50af-8e85-ad810a84c2ee" activityNameId="83cba1fd-f6fe-5323-8b03-509425e4f646" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, city car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, passenger car, electric, LiMn2O4, city car
Data are based on a LCI analysis of the Golf A4 and extrapolated for a light weight electric vehicle (650kg), no replacment of LiIo battery;
UUID: 61d262a7-e3db-3d42-9bde-26369cafe46d
The inventory includes materials used for alteration parts and energy consumption of garages. Rail and road transport of materials is accounted for.
Location: Data represent European conditions
Technology: No battery replacement accounted for.
Time period: Data represents maintenance of a modern vehicle
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data is taken from LCI of a Golf A4. 
Extrapolations: Material input extrapolated from VW Golf according to weight ratio.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_61d262a7-e3db-3d42-9bde-26369cafe46d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
